        "chosen_instruction": "###Task Description:\nAn instruction (might include an Input inside it), a response to evaluate, and a score rubric representing a evaluation criteria are given.\n1. Write a detailed feedback that assess the quality of the response strictly based on the given score rubric, not evaluating in general.\n2. After writing a feedback, write a score that is an integer between 1 and 5. You should refer to the score rubric.\n3. The output format should look as follows: \"Feedback: (write a feedback for criteria) [RESULT] (an integer number between 1 and 5)\"\n4. Please do not generate any other opening, closing, and explanations.\n\n###The instruction to evaluate:\n\"I am trying to win over a new client for my writing services and skinny brown dog media to as as a ghost writer for their book Unbreakable Confidence. Can you help me write a persuasive proposal that highlights the benefits and value of having a editor/publisher\"\n\n###Response to evaluate:\nDear [Name], \r\n\r\nI am writing to introduce myself and skinny brown dog media as a potential ghost writer for your book Unbreakable Confidence. We understand that you are looking for an editor/publisher to help you craft the perfect book, and we would be honored to be considered for the role. \r\n\r\nAt skinny brown dog media, we specialize in helping authors craft their stories. We have the experience, resources, and expertise necessary to ensure that your book is of the highest quality. Our team of editors, publishers, and writers understand the importance of creating a book that captures the essence of your message while being interesting and engaging to readers.\r\n\r\nWe also understand the importance of a well-crafted book to the success of any writer. Our team will work with you to ensure that Unbreakable Confidence is something that readers will want to pick up and read. We will help you refine your story and create a book that captures the attention of your target audience. \r\n\r\